<!--
  Friction body template (Eta). Body-only — frontmatter is synthesized
  from the entity's Zod schema by the authoring pipeline (lib/model/authoring.ts),
  which strips this comment from rendered instances.

  A friction is committed while the agent log is gitignored, so the body holds
  counts, ids and fixed labels only: never prompt, message, argument or output
  text, and never a path that resolves on one machine. `friction detect --apply`
  passes `it.observation` and `it.evidence` for a detected friction.
-->

